OL,3,GNEWSAEx-officer jailed over 'toxic'
OL,4,AWhatsApp culture
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ex-police sergeant who asked to
OL,7,Fshare a female suspect's sex video with
OL,8,F"the lads from footy" has been jailed
OL,9,Ffor four years.
OL,11,FFormer Cambridgeshire Police officer
OL,12,FPaul Street, 41, engaged in "salacious
OL,13,Fgossip" with former PC Josh Williams
OL,14,Fafter he found intimate pictures and
OL,15,Ffootage on the woman's personal phone.
OL,17,FThe Old Bailey heard how Street, of
OL,18,FHuntingdon, Cambridgeshire, created a
OL,19,F"toxic" WhatsApp culture at work. He
OL,20,Fwas found guilty of two charges of
OL,21,Fmisconduct in a public office.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
