OL,4,AWhatsApp culture
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Mark Lucraft KC said: "The public
OL,7,Fshould expect to be able to trust
OL,8,Fpolice officers to act fairly in the
OL,9,Fexecution of their powers to prevent,
OL,10,Fdetect and solve crime."
